# Workshop gallery of Ancient Buildings Renew: one story, in one place, staged (PUBLISHING.md: every gallery capture is a staged photo).
#
# THE STORY (one, seven episodes, one summer day of the save, 5th of Septober, clear sky). Who: Nelim (Virginie), who keeps the last stop of an old road, and Shogun, her labrador, who is in every picture and always doing something (trots, sniffs, follows, begs, lies in the shade, sits, keeps the light); Ravi, a traveller (shaved head, orange shirt, bowler hat) who runs the stop at noon and shares the evening; Mei, a walker (bob, blue shirt, cowboy hat) who comes in for the afternoon heat. Where: the calm zone, one square, seen from seven corners. Rhythm: hours 06, 09, 11, 12, 15, 21, 23; each episode starts where the one before ended. The thread is the WOOD: brought at dawn (1), stacked beside the fence she mends (2), burned in the stove (3), left beside the traveller (4), left in the shade (5), burning in the torches at dusk (6), cold at night (7). Episodes: 1 she brings wood at dawn to the road that is funnelled; 2 she mends the fence in the morning; 3 she cooks at the stove at eleven; 4 at noon Ravi pays the vending machine; 5 in the afternoon heat the old air conditioner cools Nelim and Mei; 6 at dusk the six buildings stand lit together and they share the last meal; 7 at night the lamppost holds the dark and Nelim walks out of its light.
# Place for all seven: the calm zone of Nelim's tribe, a cream stone square (about 11 x 11 cells, x 195-205, z 181-191) with no roof and no wall shadow, ringed by flowers and bushes on soil (PickleTools/docs/SANCTUAIRE-LIEUX.md). Weather Clear. Each scene sets its own hour.
# Zoom N frames 2N cells high and 3.56N wide (SanctuaryBacklot/docs/GALERIE.md; a cell is 540 / N px on screen, 75 / N px on the 268 px Steam thumbnail). Decor placed by a scene is removed after its shot (`the decor is removed`); built things go with the save reload at the next scenario.
# GAME PAUSED MID-PLAY (owner, 2026-10-23): nobody stands facing the photographer. Each living thing faces what it does. A moving pawn is obtained by `I order "X" to (x, z)`, `game speed is normal`, `I let N ticks pass`, `game speed is paused`; the held item is put in the hands after the pause (`carries the item` holds on a paused game). `stands at ... facing D` only places a pawn that is meant to be still. Nobody is drafted (drafted pawns get the angry combat face). Faces: kit and brows per scene, held neutral, `normal+blink` last. Only Shogun faces the camera, in shot 7 (criterion c).
#
# Nelim, one hairstyle all day: Flowy (long, loose; with the tuque in 1, with the shade cone in 5, bare elsewhere: never a ponytail or a bun under a hat). Three outfits, each with its reason (owner rule of continuity, 2026-10-23): (A) 06:00 rust parka (150, 60, 50), dark trousers (60, 60, 70), mustard tuque (200, 150, 60): the dawn is cold; face kit calm. (B) 09:00 to 15:00 cream collar shirt (230, 224, 206), brown trousers (90, 70, 50): she took the parka off when the sun rose; 15:00 adds the straw shade cone (225, 200, 140); face kits neutral (2), calm (3), smug (4), calm (5). (C) 21:00 and 23:00 burgundy cape (110, 30, 50) over the cream shirt: the evening cools again; face kits calm (6), neutral (7).
# Guests: Ravi (Male body, hairstyle Shaved, orange shirt (200, 90, 60), grey trousers (70, 70, 78), bowler hat (90, 70, 50); the same all day, face kit calm); Mei (Female body, hairstyle Bob, hair colour (60, 35, 25), blue shirt (70, 110, 170), grey trousers, cowboy hat (225, 200, 140); face kit calm). Guests wear a hat freely: only Nelim follows the long-loose-hair rule.
#
# Shotlist v3 (2026-10-23, after the 50fd captures and the Opus director's pass). Variety: wide 1 and 6, medium 2, 4, 5, 7, close 3; each shot has its own centre. Opening = 1 (the road comes in), closing = 7 (the dog keeps the light). "R" = main risk and counter-plan. Scenarios 2 to 7 below are still the v2 text: they are rewritten to this list after the owner rates it.
#   1. 06:00, WIDE opening shot, frame (200, 187) zoom 4.4 (x 193.1-206.9, z 182.6-191.4; a cell is 123 px, 17 px on the 268 px Steam thumbnail). Back: concrete barrier row (198-202, 190) and fence row (198-202, 188), a channel of five cells that funnels the road. Middle: Nelim in mid-stride. Front: two lit TorchLamp (197, 184) and (203, 184), a woodpile (a stack of WoodLog) at (196, 185) and a Stool at (204, 185): the stop is lived in. Sides: fully grown daylilies (194, 185) and (206, 185) and the ring of flowers. Living: Shogun at (199, 185) turned West, watching her come. Action: Nelim walks with a log (WoodLog) on her shoulder from the east end of the fence toward the woodpile, in profile, leaving the channel. The instant: she has just passed the end of the fence and is three steps from the woodpile; next she drops the log on it. How it is obtained: she stands at (203, 187), `I order "Nelim" to (198, 185)`, the game runs 40 ticks (`game speed is normal`, `I let 40 ticks pass`), then `game speed is paused`; the log is put in her hands after the pause (`carries the item`), which holds on a paused game. Says: the old road comes in at dawn between the concrete, and someone brings wood for the fire. Thumbnail at 268 px: the dark channel of barrier and fence over the pale stone, two orange torch flames, a small walking figure with a log.
#      R: the dawn light does not read, the torches are small, and the mid-stride pose is unplayed: the pawn may stop before the pause (the `I let` step may advance a paused game, or not). Plan: torches two cells from the bottom edge, long shadows of 06:00, scene to 07:00 if flat; the walk is checked in the log (`the movement of the colonist "Nelim" is logged for 5 seconds`) and, if the pawn has already arrived, the order goes farther (to (196, 184)) with 20 ticks. If the log leaves her hands on the walk, only the carry is applied after the pause. Faces: kit calm, 20 degrees, `normal+blink` last, face state logged here for NPT.
#   2. 09:00, medium, frame (201, 187) zoom 3.0 (x 195.7-206.3, z 184-190). Back: barrier row (199-203, 190), the upper third. Middle: fence row (199-203, 188) with ONE cell left open at (201, 188); a Steel stack on the ground at (200, 187) beside the gap. Nelim walks toward the gap, three-quarter view, carrying a steel bar (Steel). Front: a Stool (197, 185), a half-built stack of WoodLog (the dawn wood) at (196, 185), fully grown roses (194, 187) and (206, 187). Living: Shogun at (199, 186) sniffing the Steel stack, facing East. The instant: she is one step before the gap, about to set the bar in it. Obtained: Nelim stands at (203, 186), `I order "Nelim" to (201, 187)`, 40 ticks, pause, then carries Steel. Says: the fence is mended by hand, concrete that was left standing. Thumbnail at 268 px: the open gap in the dark fence and the figure at it.
#      R: the steel bar is a grey blob. Plan: the Steel stack on the ground beside the gap carries the idea, the bar in her hands may be Plasteel (light blue); roses on soil cells may be refused: the step fails loudly, then the nearest soil cell of the ring. The open fence cell must not be built.
#   3. 11:00 (flat light), CLOSE, frame (199, 188) zoom 2.2 (x 195.1-202.9, z 185.8-190.2). Back: the vending machine (198, 189) and the stove (200, 189) side by side. Middle: Nelim turning away from the stove toward the stool with pemmican (Pemmican) in her hands. Front: a Stool (197, 186), two WoodLog at (201, 187) beside the stove (the dawn wood), a bush (194, 186). Living: Shogun at (199, 187) following the meal, facing her (West). The instant: she has just taken the meal and is on the first step of her turn. Obtained: Nelim stands at (200, 188) facing South, `I order "Nelim" to (197, 187)`, 30 ticks, pause, carries Pemmican. Says: the stove cooks, and the meal leaves with its cook. Thumbnail at 268 px: stove and machine at 34 px a cell, the cream shirt against the black stove.
#      R: 11:00 is flat and the meal is small. Plan: zoom 2.2 puts a cell at 245 px, the cream shirt stands against the black stove; if the meal is unreadable, Shogun's gaze at it tells it.
#   4. 12:00 (flat light), medium, frame (198, 187) zoom 3.0 (x 192.7-203.3, z 184-190). Back: the vending machine (199, 189) with a StandingLamp (202, 189) beside it. Middle: Ravi ordered away from the machine toward the Stool, caught mid-step with his meal (MealSimple) in hand; Nelim at (199, 187) facing East toward him, holding the Silver (Silver) she is paid. Front: a Stool (196, 186), a Silver stack at (200, 188). Living: Shogun at Ravi's heels at (197, 187), facing him (East). The instant: Ravi has just paid and turned; Nelim still has the coin out. Obtained: Ravi stands at (199, 188), `I order "Ravi" to (196, 187)`, 25 ticks, pause, carries MealSimple; Nelim stands at (199, 187) facing East. Says: the vending machine feeds a traveller, and the keeper takes the coin. Thumbnail at 268 px: Ravi's orange shirt against the black machine, the lit lamp.
#      R: a meal laid on the machine reads as a second machine, the coin is small, 12:00 is flat. Plan: no meal on the ground (Ravi carries it only); the orange shirt and the lamp give the colour; if the coin is unreadable, the Silver stack on the ground says it.
#   5. 15:00, medium, frame (200, 186) zoom 3.0 (x 194.7-205.3, z 183-189). Back: a wall of five cells (197-201, 189) holding the air conditioner at (199, 189), powered on. Middle: Nelim in the shade south of the unit at (199, 187), turned East toward Mei and holding out a Cloth (Cloth); Mei caught mid-stride into the shade. Front: the Stool (196, 185) in the shade, a stack of WoodLog (the day's wood, left in the shade) at (197, 186), fully grown daylilies (194, 187) and (206, 187). Living: Shogun lying in the cool at (201, 186) with his head to the unit (a lie or sleep step is asked of NPT; until it exists he stands facing the unit, West). The instant: Mei has just come in out of the sun, Nelim offers the cloth. Obtained: Mei stands at (204, 185), `I order "Mei" to (201, 187)`, 30 ticks, pause; Nelim stands at (199, 187) facing East, carries Cloth. Says: the old machine makes a shade of cold in the heat of the afternoon. Thumbnail at 268 px: the dark wall with the pale unit, the white shade cone, Mei's cowboy hat in motion.
#      R: the cooling is only implied by the shade. Plan: unit powered on, cream shirt and straw cone against the dark wall, Mei's cowboy hat reads as heat; the lying dog needs a step from NPT (fallback: he faces the unit).
#   6. 21:00, WIDE, frame (201, 187) zoom 4.4 (x 194.1-207.9, z 182.6-191.4), an echo of shot 1 from the same corner. Two depths, not a row: far, the barrier (196-198, 190) and fence (196-198, 188) at the left, the lamppost (203, 190), the vending machine (203, 188) and the stove (204, 188) at the right; near, the wall with the unit, wall (197, 185), unit (198, 185), wall (199, 185), at the lower left. Middle: Nelim stops one step short of Ravi holding out the last pemmican (Pemmican); Ravi faces her. Front: two lit TorchLamp (195, 184) and (206, 184), the woodpile now small at (196, 183). Living: Shogun sitting between them at (200, 187), facing the pemmican. The instant: she is one step from handing it over. Obtained: Nelim stands at (203, 186), `I order "Nelim" to (201, 187)`, 25 ticks, pause, carries Pemmican; Ravi stands at (200, 187) facing East. Says: the day ends among the six buildings, the wood burning in the torches. Thumbnail at 268 px: six dark buildings, two flames, two small figures facing each other.
#      R: dusk read as day at 20:00 on 50fd, the dog overlapped Nelim. Plan: hour 21 with torches lit, hour 22 if still bright; Shogun placed between the two pawns, not behind either.
#   7. 23:00, medium, frame (200, 188) zoom 3.6 (x 193.6-206.4, z 184.6-191.4). Back: the lamppost (200, 188), glowing, with the barrier row (197-201, 185) behind and the fence row (197-201, 191). Middle: Nelim walking North out of the pool of light toward the road, seen from behind (order from (200, 187) to (200, 190), 40 ticks, pause); no chocolate (unreadable at this zoom). Front: the day left behind: two TorchLamp (197, 184) and (203, 184) placed and NOT lit, a few WoodLog at (203, 186), bushes (194, 186) and (206, 186). Living: Shogun lying in the light at (199, 186), the one animal seen from the FRONT of the series, facing South. The instant: she is leaving; he stays. Obtained as the others walk; the lamppost glow is asserted before the pawns are placed. Says: the lamppost holds the night with the sunlight it stored, and the dog keeps it. Thumbnail at 268 px: the glowing lamppost, the lit dog, a figure leaving into the dark.
#      R: the night reads as evening, and the glow assertion was never played. Plan: waits by `I let N ticks pass`, glow asserted first, hour 0 if flat; the lying dog needs a step from NPT (fallback: he stands facing South).
#
# Why this place: the calm zone is clean, level and light, so concrete and a lit lamp read on it. Every scenario reloads the save and cleans the filth.
